@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083

### Recommendations (movies-service must be reachable; OpenAI key optional)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json

{"mood":"relaxed","genres":["Comedy"],"language":"English","energyLevel":"low","maxDurationMinutes":120,"limit":3}

